Read `AGENTS.md` for ownership, simplicity, line limits, validation, and compatibility rules. Read `docs/architecture.md` before changing a boundary.

- Prefer the smallest working feature that fits existing patterns. Do not prebuild frameworks for hypothetical future apps.
- Keep one Worker deployment for React assets and Hono. Keep mobile independently owned.
- Pages/screens: 200 physical lines maximum. Other handwritten TS/Dart: 300. Split by responsibility, not arbitrary line ranges; do not minify source.
- No placeholder success, fake metrics, empty mutations, or tests that merely repeat implementation details.
- Document new configuration and reproducible setup commands. Secrets belong in local ignored files or Cloudflare secrets.
- For dependency work, inspect `pnpm why`, update related package families together, refresh the lockfile, and run `pnpm audit --prod`. Use only narrowly targeted overrides and verify the affected generator/CLI plus runtime tests. If findings remain, report them accurately rather than describing the audit as fully fixed.
